if (userId == requestUserId)

/account/{accountId}
/user/{userId}
/portfolio/{portfolioId}
/order/{orderId}

Key question
Does the backend verify:
Authenticated User
       ↓
User authorized for Account
       ↓
User authorized for Portfolio
       ↓
User authorized for Order
       ↓
Operation allowed

or does it simply trust an ID supplied by the client?
