Then manually inspect the surrounding 20–50 lines.
You are looking for business logic vulnerabilities, not just technical vulnerabilities.
For example:
if (quantity > 0) {
    placeOrder();
}

but no maximum quantity check.
Or:
if (user.isTrader()) {
    executeOrder(order);
}

but no check that the trader is authorized for the particular account.
